OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks competition finale
OL,4,Acancelled over winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe finale of an international
OL,7,Ffireworks competition has been
OL,8,Fcancelled over safety concerns due to
OL,9,Fhigh winds forecast.
OL,11,FOrganisers said they were
OL,12,F"disappointed" this year's World
OL,13,FFireworks Championship in Blackpool on
OL,14,FSaturday would not take place.
OL,16,FThousands of visitors were expected to
OL,17,Fwatch the dazzling displays which were
OL,18,Fscheduled over three nights.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
