OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks competition finale
OL,4,Acancelled over winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA VisitBlackpool spokesperson, said:
OL,7,F"Following close monitoring of the
OL,8,Fweather forecast throughout the week,
OL,9,Fthe expected wind speed and direction
OL,10,Fwould make it unsafe for the event to
OL,11,Fproceed."
